00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:24.800
<v Cris Beam>Kids will stand around gossip and laugh, go turn a trick, hang out some more, bop into nearby dance clubs on and off the boulevard.
<v Cris Beam>孩子们会站在那里闲聊大笑，去接个客，再回来聚一聚，时不时进出大道附近的舞蹈俱乐部。

