00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:29.360
<v Foxxjazell>It's been so long since I've seen you.
<v Foxxjazell>好久没见到你了。

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:34.560
<v Cris Beam>When Foxx and I dropped in at Benito's this month, she ran into an old friend she hadn't seen in ages.
<v Cris Beam>这个月当我和Foxx在Benito's停下时，她遇到了一个她很久没见的老朋友。

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.000
<v Foxxjazell>Where you living at now?
<v Foxxjazell>你现在住在哪儿？

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:49.120
<v Woman>Where am I living? I'm living with my man. I've got a husband that I've had for two years and we've got a house and got an apartment. And the months really slow, so we got to come up with half of this month's rent and still got to go come up with next month's rent on the first.
<v Woman>我住在哪儿？我和我的男人住在一起。我有了一个在一起两年的丈夫，我们有房子，还有公寓。但每个月手头都很紧，所以我们得凑够这个月的房租，而且还得在下个月一号凑出下个月的房租。

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:52.350
<v Foxxjazell>So you're out here getting your work on?
<v Foxxjazell>所以你出来这里干活了？

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:55.820
<v Woman>I don't work all the time, but just some time.
<v Woman>我不总是干这个，只是偶尔。

00:14:55.820 --> 00:15:00.130
<v Foxxjazell>I know the feeling, girl. I mean, sometimes I have to work. I have to do it too.
<v Foxxjazell>我明白那种感觉，女孩。我的意思是，有时候我必须干活。我也必须这样做。

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.020
