00:19:56.220 --> 00:20:24.500
<v Cris Beam>There's a thriving black market for hormones here in LA. And, like many prescription drugs that are purchased over the counter in Mexico, estrogen is smuggled across the border and is sold in the swap meets with other Mexican pharmaceuticals. In the rush to fill out and pass, girls will shoot massive amounts of hormones into their butts every week. Often causing PMS-like mood swings. Sometimes they'll also inject silicone and oils directly into their hips, butts, knees, and even cheeks, all to round out the harder edges.
<v Cris Beam>洛杉矶有一个繁荣的荷尔蒙黑市。而且，就像许多在墨西哥柜台售卖的处方药一样，雌激素被偷运过边境，与其他墨西哥药物一起在跳蚤市场出售。为了尽快发育和通过性别检验，女孩们每周会往屁股里注射大量的荷尔蒙。这经常导致类似经前综合症（PMS）的情绪波动。有时她们还会直接把硅胶和油注射进臀部、屁股、膝盖甚至脸颊，所有这些都是为了填补较硬的线条。

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:48.470
<v Cris Beam>There are a few doctors who will prescribe hormones to kids, but the waiting lists are long. And some feel the doses are too conservative. Foxx is going the legal route with an estrogen prescription and her doctor tells her to expect breasts about the size of her mother's. After all, you can't override genetics.
<v Cris Beam>有少数医生会给孩子开荷尔蒙处方，但等待名单很长。而且有些人觉得剂量太保守了。Foxx选择了合法的路线，持有雌激素处方，她的医生告诉她，乳房大小预计会和她妈妈的一样。毕竟，你无法凌驾于基因之上。

00:20:48.470 --> 00:21:10.950
<v Cris Beam>This particular Friday is special, as the girls are celebrating Ariel's retirement party. Ariel is 18, small, Latina, and even when she wears her baggy boy clothes, looks like a shy little girl who curls herself into her chair when she talks. She tell me she's decided to retire. To stop dressing and live as a boy for one whole month to see if she can make it. Tonight is her last night in drag.
<v Cris Beam>这个周五很特别，因为女孩们正在庆祝Ariel的退休派对。Ariel 18岁，娇小，拉丁裔，即使穿着宽松的男装，看起来也像个害羞的小女孩，说话时把自己蜷缩在椅子里。她告诉我她决定退休了。停止打扮，以男孩身份生活整整一个月，看看她能不能做到。今晚是她最后一次异装。

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:18.630
<v Ariel>Put powder on your face, your ears. Behind your ears and your neck. And your chest.
<v Ariel>在你的脸上抹粉，还有耳朵。耳朵后面和脖子。还有你的胸部。

