<v Ira Glass>[资助信用]

00:58:06.520 --> 00:58:11.810
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who explains himself this way.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由Torey Malatia负责，他是这样解释自己的。

00:58:11.810 --> 00:58:17.780
<v Foxxjazell>Last couple of jobs I've had a big problem with using the women's restroom.
<v Foxxjazell>过去两份工作我在使用女厕所方面遇到了很大的问题。

00:58:17.780 --> 00:58:55.610
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of this American life.
<v Ira Glass>我是Ira Glass，下周带着更多美国生活的故事回来。

00:58:55.610 --> 00:59:00.610
<v Announcer>PRI, Public Radio International.
<v Announcer>PRI，国际公共广播电台。
